  "articleHtml": "<main>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Black Rock Coffee Nutrition Calculator\n    </span>\n</p>\n<div>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n      Meta Title:\n     </span>\n<span>\n      Black Rock Coffee Nutrition Calculator: Calories &amp; Sugar\n     </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n      Meta Description:\n     </span>\n<span>\n      Check Black Rock Coffee calories, sugar, carbs, protein, and fat for lattes, Fuel Energy drinks, Chillers, mochas, cold brew, and more.\n     </span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<h2 class=\"text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4 mt-8 pb-2 border-b border-emerald-500/20 flex items-center gap-2.5\" id=\"h.82wnrbc525ff\">\n<span>\n     Black Rock Coffee Nutrition Calculator\n    </span>\n</h2>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Black Rock Coffee has everything from nearly calorie-free drip coffee to flavored lattes, blended Chillers, and Fuel Energy drinks. The nutrition difference between those choices can be substantial, especially once drink size, milk, flavors, and sweetness are taken into account.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Use the\n    </span>\n<span>\n     Black Rock Coffee Nutrition Calculator above\n    </span>\n<span>\n     to find your drink, compare sizes, and check calories, sugar, carbs, protein, and fat before you order.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<h2 class=\"text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4 mt-8 pb-2 border-b border-emerald-500/20 flex items-center gap-2.5\" id=\"h.w88vkotvcwq2\">\n<span>\n     The Drink Size Can Change the Numbers Quickly\n    </span>\n</h2>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     At Black Rock Coffee, moving from one size to another does more than add a few extra ounces.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     A larger flavored drink usually contains more milk, syrup, sauce, or other ingredients. That means its calories and sugar can rise noticeably.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     For example, the nutrition database currently shows the Caramel Blondie increasing from about\n    </span>\n<span>\n     420 calories for a 16 oz drink to 640 calories for a large\n    </span>\n<span>\n     .\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     When comparing drinks, always match the size in the calculator to the size you plan to order. A medium nutrition value should not be used as an estimate for a large drink.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<h2 class=\"text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4 mt-8 pb-2 border-b border-emerald-500/20 flex items-center gap-2.5\" id=\"h.u9doz3yf0o19\">\n<span>\n     Coffee Can Start Simple and Change With Customization\n    </span>\n</h2>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Plain brewed coffee, cold brew, and an Americano begin with very few calories.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     A latte adds milk. A mocha adds chocolate ingredients. Signature drinks such as the\n    </span>\n<span>\n     Caramel Blondie, Blackout, Mexican Mocha, and Caramel Truffle\n    </span>\n<span>\n     can add flavored syrups, sauces, or richer dairy ingredients.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     That is why two coffee drinks with the same espresso base can end up with very different nutrition totals.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Black Rock also allows guests to customize factors such as sweetness, milk type, espresso strength, flavors, and toppings. If your order differs from the standard recipe, the nutrition of the finished drink may differ too.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<h2 class=\"text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4 mt-8 pb-2 border-b border-emerald-500/20 flex items-center gap-2.5\" id=\"h.q1kxdcm0r97h\">\n<span>\n     Fuel Energy Drinks Need Their Own Comparison\n    </span>\n</h2>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Black Rock's\n    </span>\n<span>\n     Fuel Energy\n    </span>\n<span>\n     drinks are different from its coffee menu and should be compared as their own category.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Fuel can be ordered iced or frozen, and flavored versions include options such as Blue Lagoon, Star Burst, Mai Tai, Sunrise, and other combinations.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Some Fuel drinks also include fruit flavors or juice, which can change the calorie and sugar content.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Black Rock offers regular and sugar-free Fuel options, but do not assume every flavored Fuel drink has the same nutrition simply because the base drink is similar. Check the specific version and preparation in the calculator.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<h2 class=\"text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4 mt-8 pb-2 border-b border-emerald-500/20 flex items-center gap-2.5\" id=\"h.ybpn24phjyho\">\n<span>\n     Iced and Frozen Are Not Always Nutritionally Equal\n    </span>\n</h2>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     A drink name may be available in more than one preparation.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     An\n    </span>\n<span>\n     iced Fuel\n    </span>\n<span>\n     and a\n    </span>\n<span>\n     Frozen Fuel\n    </span>\n<span>\n     , for example, should not automatically be treated as the same nutrition entry. Blended drinks may use different ingredient quantities or preparation methods.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     The same idea applies to coffee drinks that can be served hot, iced, or blended.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     When several versions are listed, select the one that most closely matches your actual order rather than choosing by drink name alone.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<h2 class=\"text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4 mt-8 pb-2 border-b border-emerald-500/20 flex items-center gap-2.5\" id=\"h.heievv6k7bu6\">\n<span>\n     Chillers and Smoothies Are More Than Flavored Coffee\n    </span>\n</h2>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Black Rock's blended menu includes products such as Chocolate Chip Chiller, Mint Chip Chiller, Oreo Chiller, smoothies, and shakes.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     These drinks can have very different macro profiles from an Americano, cold brew, or standard latte.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     For example, blended drinks may contain larger amounts of carbohydrate, sugar, or fat because of their bases and added ingredients.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     If you are comparing two drinks with similar calories, check the\n    </span>\n<span>\n     sugar, carbs, fat, and protein\n    </span>\n<span>\n     as well. The calorie total alone does not show how the drinks differ.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<h2 class=\"text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4 mt-8 pb-2 border-b border-emerald-500/20 flex items-center gap-2.5\" id=\"h.fpsvvf6u9p4y\">\n<span>\n     Protein Drinks Have a Different Purpose\n    </span>\n</h2>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Black Rock now also offers a dedicated\n    </span>\n<span>\n     Protein Favorites\n    </span>\n<span>\n     range, including protein lattes, protein Caramel Blondie drinks, protein shakes, smoothies, and protein-boosted Fuel drinks.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     These products should be treated separately from their standard versions because adding protein changes the drink's nutrition profile.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     If protein is the main nutrient you are comparing, use the protein value for the exact drink rather than assuming that every milk-based coffee provides a similar amount.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<h2 class=\"text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4 mt-8 pb-2 border-b border-emerald-500/20 flex items-center gap-2.5\" id=\"h.zyozmqn1667\">\n<span>\n     Add Breakfast Food to the Full Order\n    </span>\n</h2>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Black Rock Coffee also serves all-day breakfast items at participating locations.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     If your visit includes both a drink and a breakfast burrito, egg bites, muffin, bagel, or another food item, add both to the meal builder.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     For example:\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Latte + breakfast burrito\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     or\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Cold brew + muffin\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     will produce a more realistic total than looking at the beverage alone.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Food availability can vary by location, so match the item with the menu at the store you are visiting.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<h2 class=\"text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4 mt-8 pb-2 border-b border-emerald-500/20 flex items-center gap-2.5\" id=\"h.xutf2d8e23g6\">\n<span>\n     Black Rock Coffee Nutrition Questions\n    </span>\n</h2><div class=\"faq-accordion-container space-y-3 my-6\"><details class=\"faq-accordion-item glass-card-static rounded-xl border border-zinc-800/80 p-0 mb-3 overflow-hidden group\"><summary class=\"faq-accordion-summary font-bold text-white text-sm md:text-base cursor-pointer list-none flex items-center justify-between p-4 bg-zinc-900/60 hover:bg-zinc-900 transition-colors\"><span>How many calories are in Black Rock Coffee?</span><span>+</span></summary><div class=\"faq-accordion-answer p-4 text-zinc-300 text-sm leading-relaxed border-t border-zinc-800/60 bg-zinc-950/40\"></div></details><details class=\"faq-accordion-item glass-card-static rounded-xl border border-zinc-800/80 p-0 mb-3 overflow-hidden group\"><summary class=\"faq-accordion-summary font-bold text-white text-sm md:text-base cursor-pointer list-none flex items-center justify-between p-4 bg-zinc-900/60 hover:bg-zinc-900 transition-colors\"><span>Which Black Rock drinks have the least calories?</span><span>+</span></summary><div class=\"faq-accordion-answer p-4 text-zinc-300 text-sm leading-relaxed border-t border-zinc-800/60 bg-zinc-950/40\"></div></details><details class=\"faq-accordion-item glass-card-static rounded-xl border border-zinc-800/80 p-0 mb-3 overflow-hidden group\"><summary class=\"faq-accordion-summary font-bold text-white text-sm md:text-base cursor-pointer list-none flex items-center justify-between p-4 bg-zinc-900/60 hover:bg-zinc-900 transition-colors\"><span>Does Black Rock Coffee have sugar-free options?</span><span>+</span></summary><div class=\"faq-accordion-answer p-4 text-zinc-300 text-sm leading-relaxed border-t border-zinc-800/60 bg-zinc-950/40\"></div></details><details class=\"faq-accordion-item glass-card-static rounded-xl border border-zinc-800/80 p-0 mb-3 overflow-hidden group\"><summary class=\"faq-accordion-summary font-bold text-white text-sm md:text-base cursor-pointer list-none flex items-center justify-between p-4 bg-zinc-900/60 hover:bg-zinc-900 transition-colors\"><span>Does changing the milk affect nutrition?</span><span>+</span></summary><div class=\"faq-accordion-answer p-4 text-zinc-300 text-sm leading-relaxed border-t border-zinc-800/60 bg-zinc-950/40\"></div></details><details class=\"faq-accordion-item glass-card-static rounded-xl border border-zinc-800/80 p-0 mb-3 overflow-hidden group\"><summary class=\"faq-accordion-summary font-bold text-white text-sm md:text-base cursor-pointer list-none flex items-center justify-between p-4 bg-zinc-900/60 hover:bg-zinc-900 transition-colors\"><span>Are Black Rock Fuel drinks coffee?</span><span>+</span></summary><div class=\"faq-accordion-answer p-4 text-zinc-300 text-sm leading-relaxed border-t border-zinc-800/60 bg-zinc-950/40\"></div></details></div>\n<h2 class=\"text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4 mt-8 pb-2 border-b border-emerald-500/20 flex items-center gap-2.5\" id=\"h.8fp66sz9xwo5\">\n<span>\n     About the Black Rock Coffee Nutrition Data\n    </span>\n</h2>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     NutritionSolver organizes available Black Rock Coffee nutrition information by drink type, size, and menu category so you can compare individual beverages or calculate a drink-and-food order.\n    </span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"text-zinc-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n<span>\n     Black Rock Coffee states that its official nutrition values are based on standard product formulations and average ingredient values. Actual nutrition can vary because of customization, ingredient substitutions, regional differences, seasonal products, and preparation.\n    </span>\n</p>\n</main>",
  "seoTitle": "Black Rock Coffee Nutrition Calculator: Calories & Sugar",
  "seoDescription": "Check Black Rock Coffee calories, sugar, carbs, protein, and fat for lattes, Fuel Energy drinks, Chillers, mochas, cold brew, and more.",
  "faqs": [
    {
      "q": "How many calories are in Black Rock Coffee?",
