    {
      "q": "Which Black Rock drinks have the least calories?",
      "a": "Plain coffee, cold brew, Americano, and unsweetened tea generally start much lower in calories than drinks containing milk, flavored syrups, sauces, or blended ingredients. Check the exact size and recipe in the calculator."
